---
description: When using openapi-fetch to generate API clients.
alwaysApply: false
---

You should use openapi-fetch to generate API clients. There is a script in the root of the repo to generate the clients, 'generate.sh'. Try to avoid using fetch directly and always use the generated client.

You can regenerate API types and blocks by running the following command:

```bash
./generate.sh
```

in the root of the repo.
